{"sourceUrl":"https://math.szu.edu.cn/info/1036/4452.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:10.124542+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://math.szu.edu.cn/info/1036/4452.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>为增进优秀大学生对深圳大学数学</span></span><span><span>科学</span></span><span><span>学院以及招生学科的了解，学院将于</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>7月</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>日</span><span>-</span></span><span><span>11</span></span><span><span>日在深圳大学举办暑期学校活动</span></span><span><span>。欢迎全国的优秀学子踊跃报名！</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、招生专业</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>070100 数学</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>含</span></span><span><span>直博研究生</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>071400 统计学</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>025200应用统计</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名对象</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.全国高校本科三年级在校生（20</span></span><span><span>26</span></span><span><span>届本科毕业生）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.就读于数学、统计学、应用统计学等相关专业；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.具有强烈的学习创新意识，学习成绩优异，科研发展潜力突出，英语水平良好；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.遵纪守法、品行端正、举止文明</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>身心健康。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、活动安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>活动时间：</span></span><span><span>7月9日报到，</span></span><span><span>7月</span></span><span><span>10-11</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>正式活动</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>活动安排：开</span></span><span><span>幕</span></span><span><span>仪式、各专业介绍、科研讲座、优秀毕业生经验分享</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>师生交流等</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>拟定</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>活动费用：暑期学校以线下方式举行，学院将为异地学校学</span></span><span><span>员提供</span></span><span><span>暑期学校</span></span><span><span>期间在深圳的免费食宿，并给予</span><span>1000元的路费报销</span></span><span><span>额度</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>仅限高铁二等票、汽车票</span></span><span><span>）。深圳地区高校学生原则上不提供住宿及路费报销，仅提供免费用餐。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>注意：</span></span><span><span>活动安排以最终公布为准，请大家持续关注；学员须按要求全程准时参加活动。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、报名方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>有意向申请的同学须在</span><span>”</span></span><a href=\"http://ehall.szu.edu.cn/yz/ybm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>深圳大学</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年硕士研究生推免生招生预报名</span><span>/（暑期学校报名）系统</span></span></a><span><span>”正式开放后</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>6月11日</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>进行预报名，网址：</span></span><span><span>https://ehall.szu.edu.cn/geapp/sys/sdyjszsxt/login/goLogin.do</span></span><span><span>，并按系统要求提交本人</span></span><span><span>以下</span></span><span><span>各项</span></span><span><span>材料</span></span><span><span>：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1）身份证正反面扫描件或者照片；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>2）学生证扫描件或者照片；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>3）包含所修全部课程的正式成绩单（院系或教务处加盖公章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>4）英语水平证明材料（四、六级英语证书，托福、雅思等成绩证明）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>5）其他能够体现本人学习及科研能力的证明材料（各类获奖证书、代表性的学术论文首页、专利授权证明等）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>网上申请截止时间：</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>25</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>，届时将视情况而定是否延期。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>注意：</span><span>1.系统填报时记得勾选左下方的“报名暑期学校项目”。2.“该系统在7月1日前仅限暑期学校报名，7月1日后开放推免生预报名。”</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五、审核选拔</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>申请截止后，招生审核工作小组将对学生的申请材料进行审核，通过资格审核者将以电子邮件或网上公示的形式通知公布。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>六、联系方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>咨询电话：刘老师</span>    <span>0755-2673 3396</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院</span><span>QQ</span><span>研招群：</span></span><span><span>184741174</span><span>（数学专业）；<span><span>920308044</span><span>（统计专业、应用统计专业）</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>学院微信公众号：<img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://math.szu.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qMzCpYMzUbnzGaUvzvPMlrVnmCPnRM6VoRU8LmvPM8LbMRG0gihFp2hmCIa0oShVLYyDnSybL7C8MlV2U8r7Ll-4Lm7ZL4-iM7C4nNM7nRMFL4CYn77bnRWFMNUaokbaptveo4OepIV8qR-aLmL0qIbtpYyPLRLDg4U8Mz-Jqd_nx&amp;oid=1941947911&amp;tid=1036&amp;nid=4452&amp;e=.png\"/></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院微信研招群：</span></span><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://math.szu.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qUz7p4MzLsL4r2UvzARozCbLlMVnRf67MN78oRW2U8WVLRl0gihFp2hmCIa0n1y8MkysM1yYM4QkUlCaL4vPnm98LmCZn7-aUm9ZMNV2UNnFnmARLmlPLzfFMm9Dn1baptveo4OepIV8qR-aLmL0qIbtpYyPLRLDg4U8Mz-Jqd_nx&amp;oid=1941947911&amp;tid=1036&amp;nid=4452&amp;e=.png\"/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://math.szu.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qnm9piMmnkMNLDUvzU4nR9PL778M8V6RL87ZLmQRL4LaL4G0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhfM1ybU1yZnNLPM7VVL4-sU4UZLzlsoRM2oz6VL77io7rFUzNDU8L4L7VFUzvbLYbaptveo4OepIV8qR-aLmL0qIbtpYyPLRLDg4U8Mz-Jqd_nx&amp;oid=1941947911&amp;tid=1036&amp;nid=4452&amp;e=.png\"/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"d76c5b7ee2c6182fd1bae3f820d912b64c7b13de6786acf7134a1bb850204b99","textLength":993,"sourceSha256":"9f8a3fce037b1d121fe805280011180e70f32ece45b8c7a71bc7cd2c2fe3dca0","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a91972528233325d6912","title":"2025年深圳大学数学科学学院2026年暑期学校预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:10.124542+00:00"}
